{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "28", "m": "10", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "07", "M": "40", "S": "12"}}, "news": [{"title": "Draw of lots for second-phase house allotment at Wayanad township on October 31", "para": "On Saturday, the draw of lots for house allotment in Wayanad township will be conducted for beneficiaries. A total of 149 houses are set to be allocated to survivors of the Mundakkai-Chooralmala landslide. Efforts are being made to ensure all necessary services are ready by November when the houses are handed over. Additionally, a study will address rainwater stagnation in the area and resolve drainage issues.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/draw-of-lots-for-second-phase-house-allotment-at-wayanad-township-on-october-31/135252184?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-174380/135252184.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "Pune: Townships forced to depend on polluted Mula water in Hinjewadi", "para": "Residents living in expansive housing developments near Hinjewadi IT Park are voicing their fears regarding the polluted water supplied from the river. Persistent complaints about discolored, yellow-tinted water have been reported, despite initiatives from local authorities. The Maharashtra Pollution Control Board is currently engaged in talks to find resolutions while acknowledging that untreated sewage significantly contributes to the travesty.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/pune-townships-forced-to-depend-on-polluted-mula-water-in-hinjewadi/135252053?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-195646/135252053.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}, {"title": "Krisala, Hiranandani Communities plan township in Nagpur; Mahindra Lifespaces signs JDA for 10.